OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FQuite extensive and thick fog
OL,6,Fto start may be quite slow to clear in
OL,7,Fthe morning. Otherwise a mostly dry
OL,8,Fday with variable cloud and bright or
OL,9,Fsunny spells. The odd shower possible
OL,10,Ffor Down and Antrim in the morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will stay dry through the
OL,13,Fevening and overnight with variable
OL,14,Fcloud and some clear spells. Chance of
OL,15,Fthe odd fog patch possible, but much
OL,16,Fless extensive than Monday morning.
OL,17,
OL,18,CTuesday:FIt will stay dry on Tuesday
OL,19,Fwith some bright or hazy sunshine and
OL,20,Fvariable cloud.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
