OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FIt
OL,6,Fwill stay dry through the end of the
OL,7,Fweek with bright or sunny spells
OL,8,Fdeveloping. Turning chillier on
OL,9,FThursday and Friday with overnight
OL,10,Ffrost possible.
